      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "with partition `n`, we will cut the first subset as len == `n` and continue to work on the rest elemetns right after the partition.\n",
