      "text": "peek & pop --> cannot access from index 0\n    because we are using stack for the implementation\n\npush --> cannot append from the index 0 \n     becase we are implementing the queue",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "peek & pop --> cannot access from index 0\n    because we are using stack for the implementation\n\npush --> cannot append from the index 0 \n     becase we are implementing the queue",
      "autoResize": true,
