      "originalText": "380. Insert Delete GetRandom O(1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gU8TJwYu3_KsZaLgByllX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8759.543721108055,
      "y": 13129.980181334044,
      "width": 1585.260498046875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1653620015,
      "version": 77,
      "versionNonce": 264277251,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789868761002,
      "created": 1789812856930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[\"RandomizedSet\", \"insert\", \"remove\", \"insert\", \"getRandom\", \"remove\", \"insert\", \"getRandom\"]\n[[], [1], [2], [2], [], [1], [2], []]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[\"RandomizedSet\", \"insert\", \"remove\", \"insert\", \"getRandom\", \"remove\", \"insert\", \"getRandom\"]\n[[], [1], [2], [2], [], [1], [2], []]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lZGOcJCYzvzOiyzrKxhtT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8744.668981041888,
      "y": 13278.907390680255,
      "width": 1343.5206298828125,
      "height": 1800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1788690063,
      "version": 2162,
      "versionNonce": 1871560205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789868768784,
      "created": 1789813119694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Idea: We will torn this problem in two:\n1. Insert/Remove O(1)\n2. GetRandom O(1)\n---\n\n1. Insert/Remove O(1): Hashmap will be the best choice for this.\nInsert: hmap[key]=val\nDelete: delete(hmap, key)\n\n2. GetRandom O(1): Array/slice ofcourse.\nran := Int.Rand(0, len(arr)-1)\nreturn arr[ran]\n\n----\nCombining two of them, we have a problem about datastructure management.\nwith insert and remove as O(1) but combine array and map.\n## Insert\nwith array, we can append consecutively. and also with map.\n\n## Remove\nThis method is trickier. As usual, to properly delete a value within\nan array, we have to iterate to that specific index/value and overwrite\nit with the rest of the array.\n\nBut we have another way, since we are using a map, we can store the\npair with {element as key - index as value}. This help us to quicky get \nthe index of the element we want to delete.\n\nAfter that, we can swap that element with the last index and shrink the \nslice 1 unit along with remove the key --> O(1) delete \n\n## Example\nSo let visualize the idea first. We have this input array [1,2,4,2] \n--- Insert 1\narr: [1,]\nmap: [{1 - 0}, ]\n--- Insert 4\narr: [1,2,4]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-2}]\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Idea: We will torn this problem in two:\n1. Insert/Remove O(1)\n2. GetRandom O(1)\n---\n\n1. Insert/Remove O(1): Hashmap will be the best choice for this.\nInsert: hmap[key]=val\nDelete: delete(hmap, key)\n\n2. GetRandom O(1): Array/slice ofcourse.\nran := Int.Rand(0, len(arr)-1)\nreturn arr[ran]\n\n----\nCombining two of them, we have a problem about datastructure management.\nwith insert and remove as O(1) but combine array and map.\n## Insert\nwith array, we can append consecutively. and also with map.\n\n## Remove\nThis method is trickier. As usual, to properly delete a value within\nan array, we have to iterate to that specific index/value and overwrite\nit with the rest of the array.\n\nBut we have another way, since we are using a map, we can store the\npair with {element as key - index as value}. This help us to quicky get \nthe index of the element we want to delete.\n\nAfter that, we can swap that element with the last index and shrink the \nslice 1 unit along with remove the key --> O(1) delete \n\n## Example\nSo let visualize the idea first. We have this input array [1,2,4,2] \n--- Insert 1\narr: [1,]\nmap: [{1 - 0}, ]\n--- Insert 4\narr: [1,2,4]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-2}]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RgfQdgv0mIvnb8J3Pzsot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9169.282004896455,
      "y": 14790.138746730237,
      "width": 328.39215087890625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223825729,
      "version": 106,
      "versionNonce": 722298947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789868761002,
      "created": 1789813787940,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--- Insert 2\narr: [1,2]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--- Insert 2\narr: [1,2]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pPIkNuLgqbKd-CAbB93H3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8752.349753474782,
      "y": 15107.544498404597,
      "width": 995.5804443359375,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1285116015,
      "version": 449,
      "versionNonce": 241002467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789868761002,
      "created": 1789813810962,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--- Remove 2\narr: [1,2,4]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-2}]\n=> From map get the index of 2: {2-1} -> 1\n=> Swap 2 with the last index, which has value 4: [1,4,2]\n=> Update new index for 4 in map: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-1}] \n=> shrink the array by 1: arr [1,4]\n=> Delete the key 2 in map: [{1-0}, {4-1}]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--- Remove 2\narr: [1,2,4]\nmap: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-2}]\n=> From map get the index of 2: {2-1} -> 1\n=> Swap 2 with the last index, which has value 4: [1,4,2]\n=> Update new index for 4 in map: [{1-0}, {2-1}, {4-1}] \n=> shrink the array by 1: arr [1,4]\n=> Delete the key 2 in map: [{1-0}, {4-1}]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DjKmVXNQJn4HV_A5QIrxN",
      "type": "line",
      "x": 10561.761745251093,
      "y": 13052.442530130691,
      "width": 2.0678586771246046,
      "height": 2590.6479954546085,
      "angle": 0,
