      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1 — no AI. Solve solo, any working approach.\n\nGiven an integer array nums and an integer k, return\nthe k most frequent elements. You may return the\nanswer in any order.\n\nExample: nums = [1,1,1,2,2,3], k = 2 → [1,2]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1 — no AI. Solve solo, any working approach.\n\nGiven an integer array nums and an integer k, return the k most frequent elements. You may return the answer in any order.\n\nExample: nums = [1,1,1,2,2,3], k = 2 → [1,2]",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
