    {
      "id": "OLJXyLQjEDqm7iDaQZWtC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12719.473374832098,
      "y": 16714.402140426286,
      "width": 1042.344482421875,
      "height": 1665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028174522,
      "version": 1207,
      "versionNonce": 1050076218,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790041907818,
      "created": 1790041371738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sort: [8,7,4,2,1]\nSmash 1: [1,x,4,2,1] --> remove ele 7 + resort\n\n--> Sort while performing a loop/iteration --> O(n^2*log(n))\n\nsort(stones) // decreasing\n\nn = len(stones) // numbers of positive element \nwhile n != 1 {\n    if stones[n-1] (8) == stones[n-2] (7) {\n        stones[n-1] (8) = stones[n-2] = -1\n        sort\n        n -= 2\n        continue\n    }\n    \n    stones[n-2] = stones[n-1] (8) - stones[n-2] (7)\n    n-=1\n    sort\n}\n\n--- heap \ninsert/remove --> log(n)\npush every elements into heap --> automatically sort!\n\nO(n) --> bulk insert.\nO(nLogn)\n\n\nwhile {\n    heap.Pop(dead ele)\n    new value = subtraced ele\n    heap.Pop(subtraced ele)\n    heap.Insert(newValue)\n}\n\n-> nlogn",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sort: [8,7,4,2,1]\nSmash 1: [1,x,4,2,1] --> remove ele 7 + resort\n\n--> Sort while performing a loop/iteration --> O(n^2*log(n))\n\nsort(stones) // decreasing\n\nn = len(stones) // numbers of positive element \nwhile n != 1 {\n    if stones[n-1] (8) == stones[n-2] (7) {\n        stones[n-1] (8) = stones[n-2] = -1\n        sort\n        n -= 2\n        continue\n    }\n    \n    stones[n-2] = stones[n-1] (8) - stones[n-2] (7)\n    n-=1\n    sort\n}\n\n--- heap \ninsert/remove --> log(n)\npush every elements into heap --> automatically sort!\n\nO(n) --> bulk insert.\nO(nLogn)\n\n\nwhile {\n    heap.Pop(dead ele)\n    new value = subtraced ele\n    heap.Pop(subtraced ele)\n    heap.Insert(newValue)\n}\n\n-> nlogn",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
